// Windows resource script embedding the app icon into the .exe. Referenced
// by build.rs via `embed-resource`, which drives `windres` from the mingw64
// toolchain — the classic `winres` crate targets MSVC's `rc.exe` and doesn't
// support the `-gnu` toolchain this project builds with.
//
// ID 1 is arbitrary but must match what `winit`'s window creation expects
// when it goes looking for "the app icon": Windows itself uses whichever
// icon resource has the lowest ID as the executable's default/Explorer icon,
// so a single entry at ID 1 is sufficient without also setting it as a
// window-class icon at runtime.
1 ICON "icon.ico"
